#: templates/users/advanced.html:51
msgid "External Image Caching"
msgstr "Mise en cache des images externes"

#: templates/users/advanced.html:54
msgid ""
"Proxy artwork from approved metadata providers through Floppy so browsers "
"and API clients do not need direct access to those providers. Cached images "
"use disk space and are removed automatically after 30 days without access."
msgstr ""
"Faites passer les visuels des fournisseurs de métadonnées approuvés par "
"Floppy, afin que les navigateurs et les clients API n'aient pas besoin d'un "
"accès direct à ces fournisseurs. Les images en cache occupent de l'espace "
"disque et sont supprimées automatiquement après 30 jours sans accès."

#: templates/users/advanced.html:58
msgid "Cached images"
msgstr "Images en cache"

#: templates/users/advanced.html:62
msgid "Disk usage"
msgstr "Espace disque utilisé"

#: templates/users/advanced.html:67
msgid ""
"Only known provider image hosts are cached (including TMDB, TVDB, "
"MyAnimeList, IGDB, Open Library, Hardcover, ComicVine, BoardGameGeek, "
"MusicBrainz, Pocket Casts, iTunes, Kitsu, and AniList). Manual URLs, local "
"services, placeholders, and unknown hosts stay unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Seuls les hôtes d'images de fournisseurs connus sont mis en cache (notamment "
"TMDB, TVDB, MyAnimeList, IGDB, Open Library, Hardcover, ComicVine, "
"BoardGameGeek, MusicBrainz, Pocket Casts, iTunes, Kitsu et AniList). Les URL "
"manuelles, les services locaux, les images de remplacement et les hôtes "
"inconnus restent inchangés."

#: templates/users/advanced.html:79
msgid "Enable external image caching"
msgstr "Activer la mise en cache des images externes"

#: templates/users/advanced.html:92
