"pointaient encore vers ces médias désormais non suivis."

#: templates/users/advanced.html:463
msgid "This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "Cette action est irréversible."

#: templates/users/advanced.html:465
msgid "to confirm."
msgstr "pour confirmer."

#: templates/users/advanced.html:481
